          rationale: "B\u1EABy \u0111\u1ED3ng nh\u1EA5t kh\xE1i ni\u1EC7m. Slide t\xE1ch e-commerce kh\u1ECFi e-business: e-business bao tr\xF9m nhi\u1EC1u ho\u1EA1t \u0111\u1ED9ng h\u01A1n."
