    bigIdeaPillars: [
      { label: "G\xE1n chi ph\xED cho \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng", body: "M\u1EE5c \u0111\xEDch 1 \u2014 cost assignment. Direct cost truy nguy\xEAn th\u1EB3ng v\xE0o cost object; indirect cost & common cost ph\u1EA3i ph\xE2n b\u1ED5. Ba kho\u1EA3n m\u1EE5c chi ph\xED s\u1EA3n xu\u1EA5t: Direct Materials, Direct Labor, Manufacturing Overhead. Prime cost = DM + DL; conversion cost = DL + MOH." },
      { label: "L\u1EADp b\xE1o c\xE1o t\xE0i ch\xEDnh", body: "M\u1EE5c \u0111\xEDch 2 \u2014 financial reporting. Product cost (DM + DL + MOH) g\u1EAFn v\xE0o s\u1EA3n ph\u1EA9m & t\u1ED3n kho, ch\u1EC9 th\xE0nh chi ph\xED khi b\xE1n (COGS); period cost (selling & administrative) t\xEDnh th\u1EB3ng v\xE0o k\u1EF3. Chi ph\xED lu\xE2n chuy\u1EC3n Raw Materials \u2192 Work in Process \u2192 Finished Goods \u2192 COGS." },
      { label: "D\u1EF1 \u0111o\xE1n theo s\u1EA3n l\u01B0\u1EE3ng", body: "M\u1EE5c \u0111\xEDch 3 \u2014 cost behavior. Variable cost \u0111\u1ED5i theo activity base (cost driver); fixed cost kh\xF4ng \u0111\u1ED5i trong relevant range (committed vs discretionary) nh\u01B0ng per-unit th\xEC bi\u1EBFn thi\xEAn ng\u01B0\u1EE3c; mixed cost t\xE1ch b\u1EB1ng Y = a + bX (high-low method)." },
      { label: "Ra quy\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBnh", body: "M\u1EE5c \u0111\xEDch 4 \u2014 decision making. Ch\u1EC9 quan t\xE2m differential cost/benefit (kh\xE1c nhau gi\u1EEFa c\xE1c ph\u01B0\u01A1ng \xE1n) v\xE0 opportunity cost; b\u1ECF qua sunk cost. Contribution format income statement (t\xE1ch variable/fixed) ph\u1EE5c v\u1EE5 ra quy\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBnh, kh\xE1c traditional format (t\xE1ch product/period)." }
    ],
    learningObjectives: [
      "Ph\xE2n bi\u1EC7t managerial accounting v\xE0 financial accounting (ph\u1EE5c v\u1EE5 ai, \u0111\u1EC3 l\xE0m g\xEC).",
      "LO1 \u2014 G\xE1n chi ph\xED cho cost object: direct cost, indirect cost, common cost.",
      "LO2 \u2014 Ba kho\u1EA3n m\u1EE5c chi ph\xED s\u1EA3n xu\u1EA5t: Direct Materials, Direct Labor, Manufacturing Overhead.",
      "LO3 \u2014 Ph\xE2n lo\u1EA1i cho b\xE1o c\xE1o t\xE0i ch\xEDnh: product cost vs period cost; d\xF2ng lu\xE2n chuy\u1EC3n chi ph\xED qua t\u1ED3n kho.",
      "LO4 \u2014 Ph\xE2n lo\u1EA1i \u0111\u1EC3 d\u1EF1 \u0111o\xE1n h\xE0nh vi chi ph\xED: variable, fixed, mixed; relevant range; ph\u01B0\u01A1ng tr\xECnh Y = a + bX.",
      "LO5 \u2014 Ph\xE2n lo\u1EA1i cho ra quy\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBnh: differential, opportunity, sunk cost.",
      "LO6 \u2014 L\u1EADp b\xE1o c\xE1o k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3 theo traditional format v\xE0 contribution format."
    ],
