          { id: "d", text: "Thu\u1EBF t\xE0i s\u1EA3n c\u1EE7a nh\xE0 m\xE1y.", isCorrect: false, rationale: "B\u1EABy (kh\xE1i ni\u1EC7m g\u1EA7n): g\u1EAFn t\xE0i s\u1EA3n d\xE0i h\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 s\u1EDF h\u1EEFu \u2192 committed cost." }
