          { term: "Absorption costing", definition: "Ph\u01B0\u01A1ng ph\xE1p t\xEDnh gi\xE1 th\xE0nh g\xE1n T\u1EA4T C\u1EA2 chi ph\xED s\u1EA3n xu\u1EA5t \u2014 direct materials, direct labor, v\xE0 c\u1EA3 bi\u1EBFn ph\xED L\u1EAAN \u0111\u1ECBnh ph\xED manufacturing overhead \u2014 v\xE0o gi\xE1 th\xE0nh \u0111\u01A1n v\u1ECB s\u1EA3n ph\u1EA9m ('fully absorb'). Chi ph\xED ngo\xE0i s\u1EA3n xu\u1EA5t (selling & administrative) l\xE0 period cost, kh\xF4ng g\xE1n v\xE0o s\u1EA3n ph\u1EA9m (s\xE1ch p.61). Job-order costing l\xE0 m\u1ED9t d\u1EA1ng absorption costing." }
