              implication: "\u0110\xE2y l\xE0 l\xFD do b\xE1n \u0111\u01A1n v\u1ECB th\u1EE9 401 l\u1EDDi \u0111\xFAng $200, kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n l\u1EADp l\u1EA1i income statement."
