          rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: machines, tooling, plant layout ch\u1EC9 l\xE0 facilities. B\u1EABy: nh\xECn nh\xE0 m\xE1y b\u1EB1ng ph\u1EA7n v\u1EADt l\xFD n\xEAn b\u1ECF qua information-processing functions. Kh\xF3a: production system c\xF2n c\xF3 support systems."
