        { id: "b", text: "Psychopathy", isCorrect: false, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: psychopathy nh\u1EA5n thi\u1EBFu quan t\xE2m/t\u1ED9i l\u1ED7i khi g\xE2y h\u1EA1i. B\u1EABy: nh\u1EA7m m\u1ECDi thao t\xFAng v\u1EDBi psychopathy. Kh\xF3a: pragmatic + emotional distance + ends/means = Machiavellianism." },
        { id: "c", text: "Machiavellianism", isCorrect: true, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: Machiavellianism = th\u1EF1c d\u1EE5ng, gi\u1EEF kho\u1EA3ng c\xE1ch c\u1EA3m x\xFAc, tin c\u1EE9u c\xE1nh bi\u1EC7n minh ph\u01B0\u01A1ng ti\u1EC7n. B\u1EABy: nh\u1EA7m v\u1EDBi narcissism v\xEC \u0111\u1EC1u thu\u1ED9c Dark Triad. Kh\xF3a: c\xE2u stem m\xF4 t\u1EA3 \u0111\xFAng \u0111\u1ECBnh ngh\u0129a Machiavellianism." },
        { id: "d", text: "Conscientiousness", isCorrect: false, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: conscientiousness l\xE0 k\u1EF7 lu\u1EADt, t\u1ED5 ch\u1EE9c, \u0111\xE1ng tin trong Big Five. B\u1EABy: th\u1EA5y pragmatic r\u1ED3i t\u01B0\u1EDFng l\xE0m vi\u1EC7c hi\u1EC7u qu\u1EA3. Kh\xF3a: conscientiousness l\xE0 desirable trait, kh\xF4ng thu\u1ED9c Dark Triad." },
        { id: "e", text: "Self-monitoring", isCorrect: false, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: self-monitoring l\xE0 kh\u1EA3 n\u0103ng \u0111i\u1EC1u ch\u1EC9nh h\xE0nh vi theo cues b\xEAn ngo\xE0i. B\u1EABy: nh\u1EA7m gi\u1EEF kho\u1EA3ng c\xE1ch c\u1EA3m x\xFAc v\u1EDBi th\xEDch \u1EE9ng b\u1ED1i c\u1EA3nh. Kh\xF3a: self-monitoring kh\xF4ng h\xE0m \xFD ends justify the means." }
