        { id: "b", text: "Core self-evaluation (CSE)", isCorrect: true, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: c\xE2u n\xF3i tr\u1EF1c ti\u1EBFp th\u1EC3 hi\u1EC7n k\u1EBFt lu\u1EADn n\u1EC1n t\u1EA3ng v\u1EC1 capability, competence v\xE0 worth sau th\u1EA5t b\u1EA1i. B\u1EABy: t\u1EF1 tin sau setback c\xF3 th\u1EC3 b\u1ECB \u0111\u1ECDc th\xE0nh optimism chung. Kh\xF3a: b\u1ED9 ba capable\u2013competent\u2013worthy ch\u1EC9 CSE." },
        { id: "c", text: "Proactive personality", isCorrect: false, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: proactive personality c\u1EA7n h\xE0nh vi nh\u1EADn di\u1EC7n c\u01A1 h\u1ED9i v\xE0 t\u1EA1o thay \u0111\u1ED5i; stem m\u1EDBi ch\u1EC9 cho self-view. B\u1EABy: 'improve next time' nghe ch\u1EE7 \u0111\u1ED9ng. Kh\xF3a: intention c\u1EA3i thi\u1EC7n kh\xF4ng \u0111\u1EE7 thay cho initiative th\u1EF1c t\u1EBF." },
        { id: "d", text: "Narcissism", isCorrect: false, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: Minh kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 hi\u1EC7n entitlement hay nhu c\u1EA7u \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ng\u01B0\u1EE1ng m\u1ED9. B\u1EABy: positive self-view d\u1EC5 b\u1ECB quy th\xE0nh narcissism. Kh\xF3a: CSE t\xEDch c\u1EF1c kh\xF4ng \u0111\u1ED3ng ngh\u0129a c\xE1i t\xF4i ph\xF3ng \u0111\u1EA1i." },
        { id: "e", text: "Emotional stability", isCorrect: false, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: b\xECnh t\u0129nh sau th\u1EA5t b\u1EA1i c\xF3 th\u1EC3 g\u1EE3i emotional stability, nh\u01B0ng l\u1EDDi n\xF3i t\u1EADp trung v\xE0o competence/worth. B\u1EABy: resilience v\xE0 CSE th\u01B0\u1EDDng \u0111i c\xF9ng nhau. Kh\xF3a: n\u1ED9i dung t\u1EF1 \u0111\xE1nh gi\xE1 quy\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBnh construct." }
