        { id: "b", text: "Situation", isCorrect: false, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: situation l\xE0 context nh\u01B0 time, place, light, social setting. B\u1EABy: early starts nghe nh\u01B0 time context. Kh\xF3a: nguy\xEAn nh\xE2n trong stem l\xE0 value c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u1EDDi quan s\xE1t." },
        { id: "c", text: "Perceiver", isCorrect: true, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: attitudes, motives, interests, past experiences v\xE0 expectations c\u1EE7a perceiver l\xE0m m\xE9o perception. B\u1EABy: c\xF3 cue t\u1EEB employee nh\u01B0ng judgment xu\u1EA5t ph\xE1t t\u1EEB value c\u1EE7a manager. Kh\xF3a: 'she personally values' l\xE0 perceiver." },
        { id: "d", text: "Consensus", isCorrect: false, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: consensus thu\u1ED9c attribution theory, h\u1ECFi ng\u01B0\u1EDDi kh\xE1c c\xF3 ph\u1EA3n \u1EE9ng gi\u1ED1ng kh\xF4ng. B\u1EABy: c\xF9ng ch\u01B0\u01A1ng n\xEAn d\u1EC5 l\u1EABn. Kh\xF3a: c\xE2u n\xE0y ph\xE2n lo\u1EA1i factor \u1EA3nh h\u01B0\u1EDFng perception." },
        { id: "e", text: "Justice", isCorrect: false, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: justice l\xE0 ethical criterion v\u1EC1 c\xF4ng b\u1EB1ng. B\u1EABy: \u0111\xE1nh gi\xE1 employee nghe li\xEAn quan fairness. Kh\xF3a: stem h\u1ECFi factor shaping perception, kh\xF4ng ethical criterion." }
