        { id: "e", text: "Negative emotions are always useless and should be punished", isCorrect: false, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: negative emotions c\u0169ng cung c\u1EA5p th\xF4ng tin v\xE0 c\xF3 moral implications. B\u1EABy: th\u1EA5y positive t\u1ED1t r\u1ED3i ph\u1EE7 \u0111\u1ECBnh negative. Kh\xF3a: qu\u1EA3n l\xFD kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i tr\u1EEBng ph\u1EA1t emotion." }
