        { id: "b", text: "A manager believes honesty matters but falsifies a report", isCorrect: true, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: belief v\u1EC1 honesty xung \u0111\u1ED9t v\u1EDBi behavior falsifying report. B\u1EABy: c\xF3 th\u1EC3 g\u1ECDi l\xE0 unethical behavior, nh\u01B0ng concept c\u1EA7n b\u1EAFt l\xE0 attitude\u2013behavior inconsistency. Kh\xF3a: cognitive dissonance." },
        { id: "c", text: "An employee feels happy after receiving praise", isCorrect: false, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: \u0111\xE2y l\xE0 affective reaction, kh\xF4ng c\xF3 inconsistency r\xF5. B\u1EABy: dissonance hay \u0111i k\xE8m discomfort. Kh\xF3a: stem kh\xF4ng c\xF3 conflict gi\u1EEFa cognitions." },
        { id: "d", text: "A team member learns a new software skill", isCorrect: false, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: learning skill kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i attitude conflict. B\u1EABy: cognition c\xF3 ngh\u0129a r\u1ED9ng l\xE0 hi\u1EC3u bi\u1EBFt. Kh\xF3a: cognitive dissonance kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i m\u1ECDi cognitive process." },
        { id: "e", text: "A customer compares two product prices", isCorrect: false, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: comparison kh\xF4ng t\u1EF1 t\u1EA1o inconsistency. B\u1EABy: c\xF3 hai l\u1EF1a ch\u1ECDn n\xEAn t\u01B0\u1EDFng dissonance. Kh\xF3a: c\u1EA7n b\u1EA5t t\u01B0\u01A1ng th\xEDch attitude/behavior." }
