      takeaway: "Goal theo \u0111u\u1ED5i v\xEC intrinsic reason v\xE0 h\u1EE3p core values th\u01B0\u1EDDng b\u1EC1n v\xE0 t\u1EA1o satisfaction/performance t\u1ED1t h\u01A1n."
