        { id: "d", text: "Give employees no feedback so they stay independent", isCorrect: false, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: feedback h\u01B0\u1EDBng d\u1EABn behavior. B\u1EABy: autonomy kh\xF4ng \u0111\u1ED3ng ngh\u0129a thi\u1EBFu feedback. Kh\xF3a: feedback l\xE0 th\xE0nh ph\u1EA7n ch\xEDnh." },
        { id: "e", text: "Pay everyone the same bonus regardless of performance", isCorrect: false, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: \u0111\xE2y l\xE0 reward design, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i goal-setting; c\xF2n l\xE0m y\u1EBFu link reward-performance. B\u1EABy: c\xF4ng b\u1EB1ng b\xECnh qu\xE2n nghe d\u1EC5 ch\u1ECBu. Kh\xF3a: c\xE2u h\u1ECFi h\u1ECFi goal attributes." }
