        { id: "b", text: "Employees should receive only externally generated feedback", isCorrect: false, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: self-generated feedback th\u01B0\u1EDDng m\u1EA1nh h\u01A1n. B\u1EABy: manager trong MBO c\xF3 v\u1EBB l\xE0 ngu\u1ED3n feedback ch\xEDnh. Kh\xF3a: c\xE2u h\u1ECFi h\u1ECFi cascading objectives." },
        { id: "c", text: "Every employee chooses unrelated personal goals without organizational input", isCorrect: false, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: MBO c\u1EA7n alignment v\u1EDBi organizational objectives. B\u1EABy: self-set goals c\xF3 th\u1EC3 t\u0103ng commitment. Kh\xF3a: kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i goals r\u1EDDi r\u1EA1c." },
        { id: "d", text: "Rewards should be hidden to preserve pay secrecy", isCorrect: false, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: pay secrecy thu\u1ED9c rewards, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i MBO. B\u1EABy: objectives v\xE0 rewards c\xF3 th\u1EC3 li\xEAn k\u1EBFt. Kh\xF3a: cascading l\xE0 c\u1EA5u tr\xFAc m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu." },
        { id: "e", text: "Difficult goals are unethical by definition", isCorrect: false, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: goal kh\xF3 c\xF3 m\u1EB7t t\u1ED1i n\u1EBFu g\u1EAFn reward sai, nh\u01B0ng kh\xF4ng unethical by definition. B\u1EABy: spec c\xF3 nh\u1EAFc m\u1EB7t t\u1ED1i c\u1EE7a goal. Kh\xF3a: MBO kh\xF4ng ph\u1EE7 \u0111\u1ECBnh difficult goals." }
