        { id: "d", text: "Hygiene factors", isCorrect: false, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: hygiene thu\u1ED9c Herzberg, ng\u0103n dissatisfaction. B\u1EABy: working conditions t\u1ED1t c\xF3 th\u1EC3 h\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3 performance. Kh\xF3a: c\xE2u h\u1ECFi h\u1ECFi Bandura." },
        { id: "e", text: "Outcome/input comparison", isCorrect: false, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: \u0111\xE2y l\xE0 equity theory. B\u1EABy: so s\xE1nh fairness \u1EA3nh h\u01B0\u1EDFng motivation. Kh\xF3a: efficacy l\xE0 belief \u201CI can do this task\u201D." }
