        { id: "e", text: "Nominal group technique", isCorrect: false, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: NGT l\xE0 k\u1EF9 thu\u1EADt ra quy\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBnh. B\u1EABy: revise strategy c\xF3 th\u1EC3 d\xF9ng technique. Kh\xF3a: stem m\xF4 t\u1EA3 development trajectory." }
