        { id: "e", text: "Faultline", isCorrect: false, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: faultline chia nh\xF3m th\xE0nh subgroup. B\u1EABy: promoted/not promoted c\xF3 th\u1EC3 chia phe. Kh\xF3a: kh\xE1i ni\u1EC7m tr\u1EF1c ti\u1EBFp l\xE0 psychological contract." }
