        { id: "c", text: "Security, affiliation, and goal achievement", isCorrect: false, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: \u0111\xE2y l\xE0 reasons people join groups. B\u1EABy: status c\u0169ng l\xE0 reason join. Kh\xF3a: ngu\u1ED3n status kh\xE1c \u0111\u1ED9ng c\u01A1 gia nh\u1EADp." },
        { id: "d", text: "Production, property, and political deviance", isCorrect: false, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: \u0111\xF3 l\xE0 categories deviant workplace behavior. B\u1EABy: deviance c\xF3 th\u1EC3 \u1EA3nh h\u01B0\u1EDFng status. Kh\xF3a: kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i sources of status." },
        { id: "e", text: "Brainstorming, interacting groups, and nominal group technique", isCorrect: false, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: \u0111\xE2y l\xE0 decision techniques. B\u1EABy: decision influence c\xF3 th\u1EC3 t\u1EA1o status. Kh\xF3a: status characteristics theory c\xF3 ba ngu\u1ED3n ri\xEAng." }
