        { id: "a", text: "Because team output depends on collective contribution and mutual accountability", isCorrect: true, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: n\u1EBFu team t\u1EA1o collective performance, reward ph\u1EA3i ph\u1EA3n \xE1nh \u0111\xF3ng g\xF3p t\u1EADp th\u1EC3 qua group-based appraisal ho\u1EB7c gainsharing. B\u1EABy: ch\u1EC9 th\u01B0\u1EDFng c\xE1 nh\xE2n c\xF3 v\u1EBB c\xF4ng b\u1EB1ng h\u01A1n. Kh\xF3a: team output c\u1EA7n mutual accountability." },
        { id: "b", text: "Because individual accountability should disappear in teams", isCorrect: false, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: team c\u1EA7n c\u1EA3 tr\xE1ch nhi\u1EC7m c\xE1 nh\xE2n v\xE0 tr\xE1ch nhi\u1EC7m l\u1EABn nhau. B\u1EABy: team-based reward b\u1ECB hi\u1EC3u th\xE0nh x\xF3a c\xE1 nh\xE2n. Kh\xF3a: x\xF3a accountability d\u1EC5 t\u1EA1o social loafing." },
        { id: "c", text: "Because rewards cannot affect cooperation", isCorrect: false, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: reward system \u0111\u1ECBnh h\u01B0\u1EDBng h\xE0nh vi h\u1EE3p t\xE1c hay c\xE1 nh\xE2n. B\u1EABy: ngh\u0129 trust ch\u1EC9 \u0111\u1EBFn t\u1EEB c\u1EA3m x\xFAc. Kh\xF3a: incentives l\xE0 context factor." },
        { id: "d", text: "Because teams never need individual performance data", isCorrect: false, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: v\u1EABn c\u1EA7n d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u c\xE1 nh\xE2n \u0111\u1EC3 ch\u1ED1ng social loafing v\xE0 ph\xE2n vai. B\u1EABy: team-based component kh\xF4ng c\xF3 ngh\u0129a b\u1ECF individual data. Kh\xF3a: c\xE2n b\u1EB1ng c\xE1 nh\xE2n + t\u1EADp th\u1EC3." },
        { id: "e", text: "Because self-managed teams have no goals", isCorrect: false, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: self-managed teams v\u1EABn c\u1EA7n goals v\xE0 reward r\xF5. B\u1EABy: t\u1EF1 qu\u1EA3n nghe nh\u01B0 t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ECBnh t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3. Kh\xF3a: reward theo nh\xF3m ph\u1EA3n \xE1nh output chung, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i thi\u1EBFu goal." }
