        { id: "a", text: "Leadership: influencing a group toward a vision or set of goals", isCorrect: true, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: Lan t\u1EA1o influence, h\u01B0\u1EDBng m\u1ED9t group t\u1EDBi service vision v\xE0 shared target d\xF9 kh\xF4ng c\xF3 title. B\u1EABy: t\u01B0\u1EDFng ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c b\u1ED5 nhi\u1EC7m m\u1EDBi l\xE0 leader. Kh\xF3a: influence toward vision/goals l\xE0 c\u1ED1t l\xF5i leadership." },
        { id: "b", text: "Formal managerial authority to issue orders", isCorrect: false, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: Lan kh\xF4ng c\xF3 formal title hay quy\u1EC1n ra l\u1EC7nh. B\u1EABy: ng\u01B0\u1EDDi kh\xE1c l\xE0m theo n\xEAn d\u1EC5 suy ra authority. Kh\xF3a: nonsanctioned influence v\u1EABn l\xE0 leadership." },
        { id: "c", text: "Management through planning and control to preserve stability", isCorrect: false, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: stem nh\u1EA5n vision v\xE0 persuasion, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i schedule/control. B\u1EABy: cross-functional initiative v\u1EABn c\u1EA7n management. Kh\xF3a: direction/influence l\xE0 leadership; order/consistency l\xE0 management." },
        { id: "d", text: "A fixed personality trait that Lan was born with", isCorrect: false, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: h\xE0nh vi influence trong case kh\xF4ng ch\u1EE9ng minh leadership l\xE0 trait b\u1EA5t bi\u1EBFn. B\u1EABy: natural persuasion g\u1EE3i Great Man/Trait view. Kh\xF3a: leadership c\xF2n c\xF3 behavioral v\xE0 contingency components c\xF3 th\u1EC3 ph\xE1t tri\u1EC3n." },
        { id: "e", text: "Reward power that makes the group comply", isCorrect: false, rationale: "C\u01A1 ch\u1EBF: kh\xF4ng c\xF3 reward n\xE0o \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c trao; group theo vision qua persuasion. B\u1EABy: m\u1ECDi influence d\u1EC5 b\u1ECB quy v\u1EC1 incentive. Kh\xF3a: reward power ch\u1EC9 l\xE0 m\u1ED9t power base, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u1ECBnh ngh\u0129a leadership." }
