          "Stress = dynamic condition khi c\xE1 nh\xE2n \u0111\u1ED1i m\u1EB7t v\u1EDBi opportunity/demand/resource li\xEAn quan \u0111i\u1EC1u m\xECnh mong mu\u1ED1n, m\xE0 k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3 v\u1EEBa uncertain v\u1EEBa important. Stress th\u01B0\u1EDDng b\u1ECB nh\xECn ti\xEAu c\u1EF1c nh\u01B0ng c\xF3 m\u1EB7t t\xEDch c\u1EF1c khi \xE1p l\u1EF1c v\u1EEBa ph\u1EA3i th\xFAc \u0111\u1EA9y hi\u1EC7u su\u1EA5t. Demands = tr\xE1ch nhi\u1EC7m, \xE1p l\u1EF1c, ngh\u0129a v\u1EE5, b\u1EA5t \u0111\u1ECBnh c\xE1 nh\xE2n \u0111\u1ED1i m\u1EB7t; Resources = nh\u1EEFng th\u1EE9 trong t\u1EA7m ki\u1EC3m so\xE1t gi\xFAp gi\u1EA3i quy\u1EBFt demands. Stress cao khi demands v\u01B0\u1EE3t resources. \u2192 M\u1EAFt x\xEDch m\xF4n h\u1ECDc: stress response v\u1EC1 b\u1EA3n ch\u1EA5t l\xE0 emotion k\xE9o d\xE0i (Topic 04) v\xE0 n\u1EBFu kh\xF4ng qu\u1EA3n tr\u1ECB s\u1EBD b\xE0o m\xF2n job attitudes/satisfaction (Topic 05) \u2014 v\xEC th\u1EBF qu\u1EA3n tr\u1ECB change kh\xF4ng t\xE1ch r\u1EDDi qu\u1EA3n tr\u1ECB c\u1EA3m x\xFAc v\xE0 th\xE1i \u0111\u1ED9."
