          "Transformational leaders \u0111\u1ECBnh h\xECnh affect t\u1EADp th\u1EC3 \u2192 nh\xE2n vi\xEAn gi\u1EEF commitment v\u1EDBi change, kh\xF4ng coi n\xF3 l\xE0 stressful; x\xE2y positive change orientation TR\u01AF\u1EDAC khi l\xEAn k\u1EBF ho\u1EA1ch: t\u0103ng self-efficacy (role clarification + th\u01B0\u1EDFng li\xEAn t\u1EE5c), t\u0103ng perceived control + th\xE1i \u0111\u1ED9 t\xEDch c\u1EF1c (cho tham gia t\u1EEB kh\xE2u planning t\u1EDBi \xE1p d\u1EE5ng); th\xEAm: t\u0103ng l\u01B0\u1EE3ng communication, \u0111\xE1nh gi\xE1 v\xE0 b\u1ED3i psychological resilience qua social support, hu\u1EA5n luy\u1EC7n emotional self-regulation."
