        analysis: 'Perception c\u1EE7a T\xF9ng th\xE0nh quy\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBnh giao vi\u1EC7c \u2192 v\u1EDBi H\xE2n \u0111\xF3 l\xE0 chu\u1ED7i s\u1EF1 ki\u1EC7n ti\xEAu c\u1EF1c l\u1EB7p l\u1EA1i. Attitude c\u1EE7a H\xE2n \u0111\u1EE7 3 th\xE0nh ph\u1EA7n: cognitive ("vi\u1EC7c m\xECnh l\xE0m ch\u1EB3ng \u0111\u1EC3 l\xE0m g\xEC"), affective (ch\xE1n n\u1EA3n), behavioral (ng\u1EEBng \u0111\u1EC1 ngh\u1ECB, c\u1EADp nh\u1EADt CV). Theo expectancy theory (T6), m\u1EAFt x\xEDch effort\u2192performance\u2192reward c\u1EE7a H\xE2n \u0111\u1EE9t: c\xF4 tin r\u1EB1ng c\u1ED1 g\u1EAFng th\xEAm c\u0169ng kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c giao vi\u1EC7c quan tr\u1ECDng, n\xEAn intensity gi\u1EA3m l\xE0 h\u1EC7 qu\u1EA3 h\u1EE3p l\xFD, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i "l\u01B0\u1EDDi". H\xE0nh vi hi\u1EC7n t\u1EA1i c\u1EE7a H\xE2n n\u1EB1m \u1EDF \xF4 Neglect/chu\u1EA9n b\u1ECB Exit trong khung EVLN (T5) \u2014 im l\u1EB7ng, r\xFAt lui thay v\xEC l\xEAn ti\u1EBFng.',
